  _tips:
  - Collect notes around the map to uncover more of the story.
  - Blocking drains your guard. Give it a moment to recover between fights.
  - When your SP bar is full, your gun fires cursed bullets that hit much harder.
  - Subtitles can be turned on or off in Settings > Gameplay.
  - '<sprite name="E"> works on almost everything: picking up items, climbing ledges and more.'
